  "prefLabel": "Elec 104.03 Copies",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Elec 104.03 Copies.\n\n(a) At the time and place identified in Elec 104.01, any person examining a document which is a governmental record may request a copy of that document.\n\n(b) The board staff shall make copies of the documents examined and requested under (a) available in accordance with RSA 91-A:4, IV and Elec 105.03.\n\nSource. #10354, INTERIM, eff 6-6-13; ss by #10421, eff 9-25-13; ss by #13739, eff 11-11-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/elec100-400.html"
